      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُرَبَةٌ</span></b>  One <i>who drinks much;</i> (ISk, S, K;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرُوبٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَّابٌ</span></b> . (S.) One says <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُكَلَةٌ شُرَبَةٌ</span> <i>A man who eats and drinks much.</i>
(ISk, S.)

